  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your balance and gait are undisturbed on the rolling and raging seas.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Sea Legs<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You ignore penalties on Acrobatics and Climb checks for slippery, slightly slippery, or sloped surfaces, and you are not denied your Dexterity bonus when making Acrobatics checks to keep your balance unless the DC exceeds 10 plus your mythic tier. In addition, your movement is not impeded by bogs, deep bogs, or water of similar depth, nor do you treat cluttered ship decks as difficult terrain, even if they are filled with crowds.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc40\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
